  <h2>What We Collect</h2>
  <p>When you submit a form on this site or respond to one of our ads, we may collect the information you provide directly, which can include: your name, phone number, email address, company name, equipment type (Box Truck, Power Only, or Flatbed), MC/DOT number, preferred lanes or regions, and any message or details you include.</p>

  <h2>How We Use It</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to your inquiry and match you with available freight or carrier partners</li>
    <li>To contact you about onboarding, including fuel card and ELD setup</li>
    <li>To follow up on quote requests from moving companies seeking backhaul freight</li>
    <li>To improve our services and the accuracy of our ads</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your information to third parties. We may share it with carrier partners, shippers, or service providers (such as fuel card or ELD vendors) as needed to fulfill the request you made.</p>

  <h2>Information From Facebook and Instagram Ads</h2>
  <p>If you submit a lead form through Facebook or Instagram, Meta collects and processes your information under its own Data Policy, separate from this one. Black Stallions LP receives the information you submit and uses it according to this Privacy Policy, including to follow up with you about freight placement, backhaul matching, or onboarding.</p>

  <h2>Data Retention</h2>
  <p>We retain your information for as long as needed to respond to your inquiry and, if you become a partner or placement, for the duration of that relationship plus any period required for recordkeeping or compliance.</p>

  <h2>Your Choices</h2>
  <p>You can ask us to update or delete the information we hold about you, or to stop contacting you, at any time by reaching out using the contact details below.</p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>We take reasonable steps to protect the information you share with us, but no method of transmission or storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

  <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date at the top.</p>

  <h2>Contact Us</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy or your information? Reach us at:<br>
  Phone: 315-953-6939<br>
  Email: Business@blackstallions.us</p>
</section>

